<div style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; color: #333; max-width: 600px; border: 1px solid #eee; border-radius: 10px;">
  <h2 style="color: #4B0082;">Hello {{userName}},</h2>
  <p>The status of your transaction for event <strong>{{eventName}}</strong> has been updated.</p>
  
  <div style="padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; background-color: {{#if isAccepted}}#e6fffa{{else}}#ffebe9{{/if}}; margin: 20px 0;">
    <h3 style="margin: 0; color: {{#if isAccepted}}#047857{{else}}#c53030{{/if}};">
      Transaction Status: {{#if isAccepted}}ACCEPTED{{else}}REJECTED{{/if}}
    </h3>
  </div>

  {{#if isAccepted}}
    <p>Congratulations! Your payment has been confirmed. Your ticket is now active and can be accessed from your profile page.</p>
  {{else}}
    <p>We regret to inform you that your transaction could not be processed. If you used points, coupons, or vouchers for this order, those assets have been <strong>automatically returned</strong> to your account.</p>
  {{/if}}

  <br />
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee;" />
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777;">Best regards,<br /><strong>Event Organizer Team</strong></p>
</div>